            "text": "Move List\nThe stat area down through the\nNature box slide right off\nscreen and large box slides in\nwith the learnset of the\npokemon, with TM's not\npurchased as dimmed. The\nStarter Move Box becomes a move\ndetail window.",
            "fontSize": 16,
            "baseFontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 8,
